  "h1": "SEO by City: Local SEO Guides for 100 Indian Cities in 2027",
  "type": "category",
  "title": "SEO",
  "content_html": "<p>City-by-city guides to SEO, answer engine optimization (AEO), generative engine optimization (GEO) and AI optimization (AIO) for businesses across India.</p>",
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "What is local SEO?",
      "a": "<p>Local SEO helps a firm show up when people nearby search for what it sells. It covers your Google Business Profile, local pages, reviews and listings.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Which cities do these guides cover?",
      "a": "<p>There are 100 guides across 30 states and union territories. They range from big cities such as Pune and Lucknow to smaller ones such as Wardha and Giridih.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Why write a separate guide for each city?",
      "a": "<p>Each city has its own trades, areas and search habits. So a plan that works in Surat may need changes in Shillong.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I get my business into Google Maps results?",
      "a": "<p>First, claim and fill your Google Business Profile in full. Then add photos, post weekly, ask every happy customer for a review and keep your details the same everywhere.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Do these guides help with AI search too?",
      "a": "<p>Yes. Each guide has AEO and GEO steps, so tools such as ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity can find and quote your business.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "Is my city missing?",
      "a": "<p>We add cities over time. Meanwhile, the steps in the nearest city guide will fit most firms, or you can <a href=\"/contact-us/\">ask us</a> about your area.</p>"
    }
  ],
